#. module: spreadsheet_help_oca
#: model:spreadsheet.tutorial,description:spreadsheet_help_oca.tutorial_api
msgid ""
"Access spreadsheet data from external systems (Power BI, Google Sheets, "
"webhooks). Bearer token, rate limit, webhook delivery log."
msgstr ""
"Greifen Sie aus externen Systemen (Power BI, Google Sheets, Webhooks) auf "
"Tabellendaten zu. Bearer-Token, Ratenbegrenzung, Webhook-Zustellprotokoll."

#. module: spreadsheet_help_oca
