#. module: spreadsheet_help_oca
#: model:spreadsheet.tutorial,description:spreadsheet_help_oca.tutorial_contract
msgid ""
"Track yearly contracts, record SLA metrics (uptime, response time) and "
"create automatic emails and activities for upcoming end dates."
msgstr ""
"Verfolgen Sie Jahresverträge, erfassen Sie SLA-Kennzahlen (Verfügbarkeit, "
"Reaktionszeit) und erstellen Sie automatische E-Mails und Aktivitäten für "
"bevorstehende Enddaten."

#. module: spreadsheet_help_oca
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:spreadsheet_help_oca.field_spreadsheet_tutorial__is_available
msgid ""
"True when the Related Module is installed (or no module is required). "
"Unavailable tutorials cannot start their tour or open their example, because"
